# The Mintlify site is docs/*.mdx plus docs.json plus the images/ assets. `mint`
# scans the whole working tree (including gitignored scratch like .venv/ and
# .superpowers/), so ignore everything, re-include just the docs dir, config and
# images, then drop the internal, non-MDX docs that live under docs/.
# .mintignore uses .gitignore-style patterns.
/*
!/docs/
!/docs.json
!/images/

# Non-published markdown under docs/ (internal design docs + research notes)
/docs/*.md
/docs/specs/
/docs/plans/
/docs/runbooks/
/docs/superpowers/
